            <note corresp="#d282-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d282-f1-content">
                <p>Source: Department of State, Central Foreign Policy File, D850182–0109.
                    Confidential; Priority; Exdis. Sent Priority for information to Bonn and West
                    Berlin. Drafted by Keith McCormick (EUR/CE); cleared by Jeffrey Gallup (EUR/CE),
                    Carol Thompson (S), Kornblum, Niles, Bruce Strathearn (S/S–O), Michelle Bova
                    (S/S), Courtney, John Kimball (C), David Miller (EB/EWT), and Philip Kaplan
                    (S/P); approved by Shultz.</p>
            </note>
